<title>UK: April IPE gas oil delivery 107,200 tonnes - IPE.</title>
<headline>April IPE gas oil delivery 107,200 tonnes - IPE.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Physical delivery against the expired IPE April gas oil contract will be 1,072 lots, or 107,200 tonnes, an IPE official said on Thursday.  </p>
<p>Deliveries against the March contract were 148,200 tonnes, while a record delivery of 865,100 tonnes was posted in November.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 5387</p>
</text>
